## SQ-FDI-05 | lunchbox blacklist in the new world's server configs (static half)
@group A
@commands Blacklist is set in `defaultconfigs/` (new worlds) and the three worlds' Apple Pie copies; check `saves/<world>/serverconfig/solcarrot-server.toml` has it too. Put each food kind into a lunchbox; open both books; hover a lunchbox (FDI-08, FDI-10)
@pass no lunchbox listed in the Food Dictionary; lunchbox still accepts foods; lunchbox tooltip says it does not contribute to food diversity
@fails blacklist hits the container slots: drop it and filter the book list instead
@from batches/r1113/c4_a.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
shell L=$(grep -m1 '^level-name=' server.properties | cut -d= -f2); for f in "$L"/serverconfig/solcarrot-server.toml "$L"/serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml; do echo "== $f"; grep -n "blacklist" "$f" | cut -c1-300; done
look both files list solapplepie:lunchbox, lunchbag, golden_lunchbox and creativedelight:netherite_lunchbox; book listing and the lunchbox tooltip are client (CQ)

